@startuml lifecycle-model
title Surrogate model — lifecycle
hide empty description

[*] --> Candidate : investigator defined\n(arch × capability)
Candidate --> Training : learner loop iteration
Training --> Evaluated : criterion task on\nshared validation data
Evaluated --> Training : below objective,\nnext iteration
Evaluated --> Registered : artifact + metrics\nto registry (MLflow)
Registered --> Selected : cross-model learner\nupdates selector
Registered --> Standby : not selected
Standby --> Selected : SelectorUpdate
Selected --> Serving : inference loop loads\nregistry reference
Serving --> Superseded : newer model version\nselected
Superseded --> Standby
Standby --> Retired : investigator stopped
Retired --> [*]
@enduml
